translations of parts of the Java runtime emulation of GWT
(https://www.gwtproject.org, https://github.com/gwtproject/gwt). They were
made from the compiled form of that code in lib/elk-worker.js of elkjs
0.9.3. The Go files are changed versions of the GWT code.

